# Comet, Stellar Pup rolls a 5: "Comet deals damage equal to the number of loyalty counters on him to a creature or player,
# then [-2]." Bot2 destroys Comet with Bitter Triumph (paying 3 life) in response to the ability, so by the time it resolves Comet has left the battlefield: the ability
# still resolves (CR 113.7a) and uses Comet's last known information (CR 608.2h), five loyalty counters, so the player
# Bot1 picks, Bot2, takes 5 (20 - 3 life paid for Bitter Triumph - 5 = 12). The [-2] has nothing to act on.

